---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Client Results & Testimonials"
  description="Client results and testimonials for Texas Movement Consulting engagements, plus a short form to share how your engagement went."
  path="/testimonials"
>
  <style>
    .testimonial-card {
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      background: var(--panel);
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .testimonial-card blockquote {
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-style: italic;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--tension);
      padding-left: 1rem;
    }

    .testimonial-author {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }

    .testimonial-author strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .form-frame-wrapper {
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      background: var(--paper);
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .form-frame-shell {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 140%;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .form-frame-shell iframe {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 0;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .form-frame-shell {
        padding-top: 120%;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">CLIENT RESULTS</div>
      <h1>Client results &amp; testimonials.</h1>
      <p>
        Every TMC engagement is a founder or operator going from stuck to moving forward. These stories help the next
        builder decide whether TMC is right for them &mdash; and they&rsquo;re a two-way street: when you share what
        changed, we feature your brand and link people straight back to you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight section--panel">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How your words get used</h2>
      <ul class="steps" style="list-style: disc; margin-top: 0;">
        <li>We only share your words publicly if you explicitly opt in inside the form and choose how you&rsquo;re credited.</li>
        <li>When we feature you, we link to your site and main social handle so people can find, follow, and buy from you.</li>
        <li>Your testimonial may appear on this site, in sales decks, or in private proposals &mdash; always attributed the way you asked.</li>
        <li>If you prefer to stay anonymous or want something removed later, we honor that, no drama.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <strong>First featured client:</strong> Diamond Kouture Beauty &mdash; vegan lip cosmetics, now live and shoppable
        at
        <a href="https://diamondkbeauty.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">diamondkbeauty.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Worked with TMC? Take 3&ndash;5 minutes to share how it went below. It helps the next founder make a confident
        decision &mdash; and gets your brand a feature with a link back to you.
      </p>

      <article class="testimonial-card">
        <blockquote>
          Everything was at a standstill before TMC stepped in. Now people can feel more safe, secure, and confident
          when they shop, and I&rsquo;m more confident my business can receive more sales than before. TMC came in and
          fixed everything in no time &mdash; no delays in communication, and they worked side by side with me
          throughout the entire process. Their hands-on, audit-first approach felt like real diagnostics for my
          business, and they were patient, professional, and clear about exactly what I needed to be successful. If
          you want to be successful, come to TMC.
        </blockquote>
        <p class="testimonial-author">
          <strong>Diamond Osayande</strong>
          <em>Founder, Diamond Kouture Beauty &mdash; Cruelty-Free, Plant-Based Lip Cosmetics</em>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight section--panel">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="form-frame-wrapper">
        <h2>Share your results</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">This short form covers what changed, what stood out, and how you&rsquo;d like to be featured.</p>
        <div class="form-frame-shell">
          <iframe
            title="Texas Movement Consulting testimonial submission form"
            src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScOE5a1cfs76S8cLXH_xvT27IW_QOH4iKNUhajD57oSUOEKiQ/viewform?embedded=true"
            loading="lazy"
          >
            Loading&hellip;
          </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
